# agent-prompts

Reusable playbooks live in **agent-prompts** (`~/projects/agent-prompts`).
Prefer stubs under `prompts/`. Do not vendor unless the user asks for an in-repo SHA pin.

This repo is the **public** product tree. Bet Tree sheets, monetization, capacity/kill strategy, and the full HQ checklist belong only in private sibling `denyout-hq`.

## Invoke

Open `~/projects/denyout-hq/denyout.code-workspace` when possible. Then:

- Public tree: `@agent-prompts/conventions/public-tree.md`
- Public vs HQ: `@agent-prompts/conventions/public-hq-split.md`
- Honesty: `@agent-prompts/conventions/unknown-honesty.md`
- QA (once Go/CI exist): `@agent-prompts/qa/protocol.md` + slice, or `@agent-prompts/qa/comprehensive.md`
- Stubs: `prompts/`

## Sync

```bash
git -C ~/projects/agent-prompts fetch origin
git -C ~/projects/agent-prompts rev-list --left-right --count HEAD...origin/main
```

If behind and clean: `ff-only` merge onto `main`. Missing clone → ask to clone `nareyko/agent-prompts`.
